      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于自身境遇或身体条件，抑或是这两者皆不顺心如愿，\n而心怀悔恨地引退的赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaee632c6b6ec48a622a0993767d5d63543833d59479559af55096bec929bb79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
