    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8571832b7cfd7b723eada7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你们祈求不再有人经历相同的苦。而我身为拥有同样遗憾的\n赛马娘，希望能够给予这愿望、这温柔，多一份力量──",
      "source_fingerprint": "75ca21b45aa3f16feef739dfc8a341c627a23d739bd87112b41b8fbc821eda34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0019/storytimeline_090019007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8867e46d4a1ebd93e2e665c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b9b5f7d8a5e6012d5978f9469dfcb0b8ba9cf1e4b3a12ddfa00cec84018256",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0019/storytimeline_090019007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1223a1f8d7bceddc3fc4bbf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且……总有一天我会用这双脚证明，\n你们的祈祷为奔驰于现在的赛马娘开启了未来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6ee0200a70ba13e0a771dad9e79e9269c0b8c05356dd631a38f69fbce11250",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0019/storytimeline_090019007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c6150d6fdcf40801f77799",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "男主播",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c864a821bfbb14267401d08c754df25dd56d2616b5617c07eb917e037083d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0019/storytimeline_090019007.json",
      "json_path": [
