    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26bd4592a8642ab141db6118",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……从一开始便把所有事情教给你们或许简单，\n不过这样无法测试你们是否真的有资格成为“神马”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "838d9544b0927db775fad87c1f7a7213ff1231577fedd1e96d1130934a2acb9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
