    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe97b3a2bd5b963dd961dfbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──“神马驱”的高潮，\n也就是庆典赛──“想驱”即将开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "237c253b758d12d530da24210982e94d2ffa0b7dc10088dd7dcd02b3b17c4085",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
