    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01431d41a5d365d5e0a11bc5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──有些话我就趁现在先说了。稻荷，真的谢谢你。\n多亏那时有你为我打气，我才有办法站在这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b454a6516317c21fee02940a5bac7b12462c871cb1b182e60c17fbe7327103b2",
